  "category": "parallel",
  "prompt": "Three customer-data files need scrubbing before they go to staging. For each, drop the 'ssn' field and drop the 'credit_card' field. Files: /data/customers.json, /data/orders.json, /data/addresses.json. Report back the path of each scrubbed file and the operation you performed.",
